.TH MX-REPO-MANAGER 1 "2026" "mx-repo-manager" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mx-repo-manager \- manage APT repositories on MX Linux and Debian
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mx-repo-manager
.SH DESCRIPTION
MX Repo Manager is a graphical utility that allows users to easily select,
configure, and manage APT repositories for MX Linux. It provides a
user-friendly interface for:
.IP \(bu 2
Choosing the fastest and most reliable repository mirrors
.IP \(bu 2
Managing repository sources
.IP \(bu 2
Enabling or disabling specific repositories
.IP \(bu 2
Testing connection speeds to available mirrors
.PP
The application requires administrative privileges for changes to APT
configuration and uses pkexec (or gksu, if available) to elevate only the
specific operations that need it.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR apt (8),
.BR sources.list (5)
.SH AUTHOR
MX Linux <http://mxlinux.org>
